  ```powershell
  magick "[INPUT_IMAGE]" ^
  ( +clone -alpha transparent -background none -fill white -draw "roundrectangle 0,0 %[fx:w-1],%[fx:h-1] 40,40" ) ^
  -alpha set -compose DstIn -composite ^
